# We don't want any old CVS repository stowing its .cvsignore
# into my ~ directory; however this global stow ignore list
# gets overridden by the local one in my cvs repo which does
# *not* contain .cvsignore.  So the .cvsignore from that
# repo, and only that repo, gets stowed in ~.
#
# Similarly for .gitignore and my git repo.
