# Per-repository opt-in marker, read from the repo root -- it means
# nothing in ~, and stowing it collides with ai-config, which also
# provides one and owns ~/.beads-solo.  The collision aborted stow for
# this entire package, not just this file.
#
# ~/.stow-global-ignore already lists this, but a local ignore file
# REPLACES the global list rather than adding to it, so every global
# entry has to be repeated here.  Keep this file in sync with the
# global one when that gains entries.
